title: Pele diagram test
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

''Pele diagram test'' — one sample per diagram type pele supports, with lorem ipsum labels. Check the palette, the node and edge colours, the active node and the fonts on each one.
⁂⁂⁂
title: 01 Flowchart
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

''Flowchart'' — lorem ipsum dolor sit amet.
<$mermaid>
flowchart LR
    A[Lorem ipsum] -->|dolor| B{Sit amet?}
    B -->|yes| C[Consectetur]
    B -->|no| D([Adipiscing])
    C --> E[(Elit sed)]
    D --> E
</$mermaid>
⁂⁂⁂
title: 02 Flowchart ELK
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

''Flowchart (ELK layout)'' — lorem ipsum dolor sit amet.
<$mermaid>
flowchart-elk LR
    A[Lorem ipsum] --> B[Dolor sit]
    A --> C[Amet consectetur]
    B --> D[Adipiscing elit]
    C --> D
</$mermaid>
